          "name": "time of death",
          "value": "6:35 a.m.",
          "unit": "local time",
          "sentence": "\"It is with deep sadness that we announce that His Majesty King Harald passed away today. King Harald passed away peacefully at Oslo University Hospital on Friday, August 28 at 6:35 a.m.,\" the palace said in a statement.",
          "occurrence_id": "occurrence-0971fff31fbd520482a733d0c02f105870d9e61b895bdbc0d69bb8397435f4f9-bc18442c9a0b124a"
